Hi,

I was terribly grieved to be killed by a vampire lord the other week.
So much that I had forgotten about it until I reached the same level (1
above bottom of Mines) and found myself facing a vampire lord again.

But this time something was different.  My foe had a vampire next to
him moving around and looking for a fight !!!

I was much more powerful  this time, and easily dispatched the vampire
lord, and then I turned my attention to the vampire.

During the melee I was surprised to see it say phrases "You hit
BigDave" and "BigDave bites you!".  I didn't know that if you were
killed by a vampire lord (or maybe just a vampire?) that if your game
is saved as a bones level then you will come back as a vampire for the
next player.  Someone really thought this out !!

After a few rounds I killed the vampire and was pleasantly surprised to
see all the items I had amassed from a few weeks ago along with
BigDave's corpse !  And they were all uncursed!!!  I was happy to
plunder them and go on my merry way.

Has anyone else had this happen to them?  I'd guess there aren't many
other creatures you could come back as (green slime, perhaps?) and
fight yourself and have the objects you had in your posession be
uncursed.

Big Dave



